description:
'''
[[]#ff0000]Aziris[[]] is a planet of breathtaking beauty and immense value, coveted by many factions for the rare and powerful [[]#bf2851]Erythronite Crystals[[]].
For centuries, Aziris has remained in the hands of the [[]blue]Sentinels[[]]. Now it is up to you to conquer this planet and seize its resources for yourself.

-------

This is a WIP mod that adds a new planet, Aziris, with plenty of new content to explore.
There isn't a campaign yet, but all mod content can be checked out in sandbox, and you can join the discord for custom maps (and more!):

[[]purple] https://discord.gg/2qc4WaCreP [[]]

Currently unavailable for mobile platforms, sorry :/
'''
subtitle: "Finally in V8!"
